job secret-scan	flag project	limit scan to a project
job secret-scan	flag redact	redact every terminal hit
job secret-scan	flag server	server address (overrides config server.addr)
job secret-scan	flag since	only jobs started within a duration (for example 24h)
job secret-scan	flag token	bearer token override (prefer config/env: GOFER_SERVER_TOKEN)
